#: ../../reference/romfs.rst:215
msgid "Automatic mounting at boot"
msgstr "Pemasangan otomatis saat boot"

#: ../../reference/romfs.rst:217
msgid ""
"When ROMFS support is enabled in the firmware, MicroPython will "
"automatically attempt to mount the first ROM partition at ``/rom`` during "
"initialisation. If the partition contains a valid ROMFS image, it is mounted"
" and both ``/rom`` and ``/rom/lib`` are added to ``sys.path`` automatically."
msgstr ""
"Ketika dukungan ROMFS diaktifkan dalam firmware, MicroPython akan secara "
"otomatis mencoba memasang partisi ROM pertama di ``/rom`` selama "
"inisialisasi. Jika partisi berisi citra ROMFS yang valid, maka akan dipasang"
" dan baik ``/rom`` maupun ``/rom/lib`` ditambahkan ke ``sys.path`` secara "
"otomatis."

#: ../../reference/romfs.rst:222
msgid ""
"This means that after deploying a ROMFS image with ``mpremote``, a soft-"
"reset is sufficient to make the new modules importable."
msgstr ""
"Ini berarti bahwa setelah men-deploy citra ROMFS dengan ``mpremote``\\ , "
"soft-reset sudah cukup untuk membuat modul-modul baru dapat diimpor."

#: ../../reference/romfs.rst:225
msgid ""
"If no valid ROMFS image is found in the partition (e.g. on a freshly-"
"programmed board), the mount is silently skipped."
msgstr ""
"Jika tidak ada citra ROMFS yang valid yang ditemukan dalam partisi (misalnya"
" pada board yang baru saja diprogram), pemasangan akan dilewati secara diam-"
"diam."

